    "text": "After more than eight years in transit, BepiColombo is in orbit around planet Mercury!\n\nThe joint ESA & JAXA mission had an exciting day today, with communications between the spacecraft and Earth being reestablished just a little while ago, following a planned burn to place it in orbit!!",
