    "text": "66 years ago today, Mercury-Redstone 1 made its famous \"four-inch flight\". At 9:00 am EST on 21 November 1960, the uncrewed Redstone lit up on LC-5 at Cape Canaveral, rose about four inches, then shut down and settled back onto the pad.",
