    "text": "On 23 November, Ariane 6 will lift off from Europe’s Spaceport, carrying 36 Amazon Leo satellites into orbit.\n\n📺 Watch live from 11:39 GMT / 12:39 CET.\n▶️ youtube.com/live/k2adMyxSoJE\n\n@transport.esa.int",
