    "text": "🏳️‍🌈 Progress Pride flags are flying at ESA today to mark LGBTQIA+ People in STEM Day.\n\nIt's a visible sign of our support for a workplace where everyone can be themselves, contribute and thrive.\n \n#LGBTQIAinSTEMDay #SpaceForAll",
