    "text": "Joby aviation will need to train new pilots, and I wanted to get an idea of what would be required by flying their simulators, learning the procedures, and handling a not entirely surprising propulsion failure.\nyoutu.be/d5rfUsHB6-I",
    "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/scottmanley.bsky.social/post/3n2jkw6qhc22q",
